// MiniBankDrills  (category: MiniBank Look-ahead; parameters: -)
// MiniBankDrills() - Look-ahead v1.0 helper: lab drill windows (labelled, series and mystery test runs recorded in
// MiniBankMystery_CL), each widened by 5 minutes after its end. Look-ahead baselines, trends and the service budget leave
// these minutes out, so drills never count as normal behaviour.
MiniBankMystery_CL
| where isnotnull(StartUtc)
| summarize EndUtc = max(EndUtc) by RunId, Slot, StartUtc
| project RunId, Slot, DrillStart = StartUtc, DrillEnd = iff(isnull(EndUtc), StartUtc + 20m, EndUtc) + 5m
